message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Goldbach numbers in intervals of length 2 log² x under the Riemann hypothesis"
authors:
  - family-names: Vynohradov
    given-names: Anton
version: "0.4"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24441477
date-released: 2026-11-22
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Conditional on the Riemann hypothesis, every interval (x, x + 2 log² x] with x ≥ 4 contains
  a Goldbach number (previous constant: 123). Paper, interval-arithmetic checks, and a
  conditional Lean 4 formalization. Unreviewed preprint, prepared with AI assistance.
